        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Klepto, The Secret World of Alex Mack, Who the Fuck Is That?\n- People: Meredith Bishop, Jsu Garcia, T-Pain, Akon\n- Organizations: Nickelodeon\n- Topics: films, television series, songs, remixes\n\nFacts:\n- The Secret World of Alex Mack ran on Nickelodeon from 1994 to 1998.\n- Meredith Bishop is perhaps best known for playing Annie Mack in The Secret World of Alex Mack.\n- Klepto is a 2003 straight-to-DVD independent thriller film.\n- Klepto stars Meredith Bishop and Jsu Garcia.\n- The official remix of the song Who the Fuck Is That? features T-Pain, Akon, and Klepto.",
